  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/e7/72/8d/e7728d6f249c047dcaa4cfeee7ca454d.png\" alt=\"命运时代横幅\" width=\"1184\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p>&lrm; &lrm; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMqZhxk7gA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/831803522281635850?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"172\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://patreon.com/KnightDexx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=KnightDexx&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rent -a server-9cf?style=for-the-badge&logo=Codeforces&logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"租用服务器\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dexxknight1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-modpacks-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"项目\" width=\"132\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdexxknight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Support me on Ko-fi&color=C0C0C0&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fage-of-fate%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"MMC评测\" width=\"390\" height=\"65\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#f60\"><strong>⚔️ 欢迎来到命运时代 ⚔️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">当世界陷入午夜般的黑暗，所有希望似乎都将熄灭时，一道光芒破晓而出——<strong>命运时代</strong>已然降临，而<strong>你</strong>正立于其中心。作为传说中的预言天使，唯有你拥有将人类从毁灭边缘拉回的力量。暗影汇聚，恶魔潜伏，无情的厄运如影随形地追踪着你的每一步。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">《命运时代》不仅仅是一场挑战；它是一段充满危险、敬畏与宿命的<strong>神秘奥德赛</strong>。拥抱远古魔法，挥舞深不可测的武器，发掘被封印的附魔遗物，并掌握早已失传于传说中的技艺。在旅途中，发现通往奇异维度的传送门，击败强大的首领，并通过那些深刻影响灵魂抉择来塑造你的命运。你将化身夜行吸血鬼，还是驯服巨龙向敌人降下火雨？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">在这个被救赎与毁灭撕裂的领域中建立联盟，揭开秘密，定义你的传奇。世界正处于遗忘的边缘——你的双翼将带来治愈之光，还是你会屈服于步步紧逼的阴影？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#f00\"><strong>命运时代，此刻开启。整装待发，旅程在即。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 系统需求</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>推荐内存：</strong>为 Minecraft 分配 16GB 至 22GB 运行内存</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Java：</strong>需要 Java 17 或更高版本（建议使用<a href=\"https://github.com/TheUsefulLists/UsefulMods/blob/main/JavaArgumentsOptimization.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">优化的 Java 启动参数</a>以获得最佳性能）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>❌ 与此整合包不兼容（光影已通过 Oculus/Rubidium 内置）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong>1.20.1 Forge</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/2d/ef/e7/2defe7b6a46221c4da3fd4d04d8742ca.png\" alt=\"功能特性横幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#c00\"><strong>🎯 《命运时代》的独特之处？</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>📖 史诗级任务系统</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跨越16个章节组与72章，包含<strong>4,800+ 项任务</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">从新手到传奇英雄的全程引导式进度推进</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">随着游玩展开的剧情驱动叙事</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">独特的终局任务：制作<strong>命运枢纽</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>🌍 8个独特维度等待探索</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a> - 充满谜团的魔法林地</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天堂</a> - 天空中的浮空岛屿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">幽暗地底</a> - 基岩之下的黑暗地下世界</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">碧蓝天空</a> - 永恒黎明与永恒白昼两大天界领域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">还有更多充满危险与宝藏的维度等你发现！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>✨ 魔法与神秘学</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法</a> - 自然魔法与魔力操控</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁法与法术书</a> - 动态施法系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">新艺术魔法</a> - 可自定义的法术构筑</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evilcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">邪恶工艺</a> - 黑暗艺术与血魔法</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">还有众多奥术体系等待精通！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>⚙️ 科技与自动化</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用机械</a> - 高级机械与数字化采矿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-foundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">热力系列</a> - 动力生成与物料处理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">精密存储</a> - 高级物品管理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸工程</a> - 多块机器与线路布线</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-reactors\" rel=\"nofollow\">极端反应堆</a> - 核能发电提供海量能源</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">构建复杂的自动化系统，打造终极装备！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>👹 史诗级首领战</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有维度均设有独特首领，掉落专属战利品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渐进式难度曲线，带来真正的高强度挑战</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首领掉落物是终局制作的必需品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与传奇生物的特别遭遇战</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>🏪 玩家驱动的经济系统</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>玩家商店系统</strong> - 与其他玩家自由交易</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>NPC商店</strong> - 购买基础物资与稀有道具</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基于玩家活跃度的动态经济市场</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完成任务奖励为你的成长提供资金保障</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>🎮 独特玩法特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">终末重置</a>开辟通往末地的全新路径</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">战利品保护</a> - 每位玩家享有专属战利品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">融合<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">千奇百怪的生物群系</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">环境音效</a>打造沉浸式世界氛围</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自多个模组的丰富武器与工具种类</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">技能成长系统，支持深度角色自定义</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">世界中散布着地下城、建筑结构与隐藏秘密</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#90c\"><strong>💎 命运枢纽 - 终极终局目标</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作传奇装备<strong>命运枢纽</strong>作为你的最终目标</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需通过探索与首领战收集<strong>20种稀有神秘石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">融合石材以打造<strong>超脱之石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与来自终局首领的<strong>8枚闪电能量水晶</strong>融合</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最终凝聚为<strong>命运精华</strong>，进而铸就<strong>命运枢纽</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整任务线将全程指引你完成这段史诗旅程！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#f60\"><strong>📊 整合包数据一览</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精心筛选与配置的<strong>730+ 模组</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整融入剧情的<strong>4,800+ 任务</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">横跨72个任务章节的<strong>16个章节组</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可供探索与征服的<strong>7大维度</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">全维度共计<strong>100+ 场首领战</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过 KubeJS 集成实现的<strong>5000+ 自定义合成配方</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>零 KubeJS 警告</strong> —— 专业级整合包品质</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/29/72/86/29728659a2e248e5eb3300ac6e80c8e4.png\" alt=\"服务器托管横幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linko